WEBVTT

01:38.160 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.100 --> 01:43.970
[Episod 19]

01:53.990 --> 01:54.660
Abang long,

01:54.910 --> 01:56.970
adakah awak sakit setelah terjatuh?

01:57.009 --> 01:57.670
Abang long?

01:59.090 --> 02:00.350
Saya menasihati awak,

02:00.760 --> 02:02.200
